id=peridot-qca6750-injection-test
name=Peridot QCA6750 Monitor and Injection Test
version=0.8
versionCode=8
author=CoderArceus
description=Stock-aligned injection driver for POCO F6 (peridot) QCA6750 with STA helper vdev injection, Stryker auto-channel support, pwm channel auto, and monitor WEXT support (no crash, live packet injection, no channel -1). Compatible with KernelSU, SuKiSU Ultra, APatch, and Magisk.
